description:
Saves one line of a poem to the reader's ReadingRate quotes, tied to its exact place in the poem, with an optional note. Saved lines appear with their other quotes and come up in quote review.

Use when the reader asks to save, keep or remember a line of a poem. To write a note about a line without saving it as a quote, use annotate_poem_line. Each call saves the line again, so save a line once.

Example: {"anchor": "wyatt/whoso-list-to-hunt/13"}
